  "notes": "Foundation (ABS: Pre-Year 1) is the first year of primary school in every state, so it is year 1 here and Year 12 is year 13. Its state names: Kindergarten (NSW, ACT), Prep (Qld, Vic, Tas), Reception (SA), Pre-primary (WA), Transition (NT). In WA, Kindergarten is the year before Pre-primary. Years 11-12 are commonly called senior secondary."
